{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Typing :: Stubs Only"], "description": "## Typing stubs for gevent\n\nThis is a [type stub package](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/tutorials/external_libraries.html)\nfor the [`gevent`](https://github.com/gevent/gevent) package. It can be used by type checkers\nto check code that uses `gevent`. This version of\n`types-gevent` aims to provide accurate annotations for\n`gevent==26.9.*`.\n\nThis package is part of the [typeshed project](https://github.com/python/typeshed).\nAll fixes for types and metadata should be contributed there.\nSee [the README](https://github.com/python/typeshed/blob/main/README.md)\nfor more details. The source for this package can be found in the\n[`stubs/gevent`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/tree/main/stubs/gevent)\ndirectory.\n\nThis package was tested with the following type checkers:\n* [mypy](https://www.mypy-lang.org/) 2.4.1\n* [pyrefly](https://pyrefly.org/) 1.4.0\n* [pyright](https://microsoft.github.io/pyright/) 1.1.414\n* [ty](https://docs.astral.sh/ty/) 0.0.95\n\nIt was generated from typeshed commit\n[`13ffe24f8b9d0069a7a45c42eed3f5513e1472a1`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/commit/13ffe24f8b9d0069a7a45c42eed3f5513e1472a1).\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["License-File"], "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": "Apache-2.0", "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "types-gevent", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/types-gevent/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/types-gevent/", "project_urls": {"Changes": "https://github.com/typeshed-internal/stub_uploader/blob/main/data/changelogs/gevent.md", "Chat": "https://gitter.im/python/typing", "GitHub": "htt